Package: manby
Title: Vector Tilesets Like 'tippecanoe', Several Times Faster
Version: 0.1.9
Authors@R: person("Birk", "Skyum", email = "birk.skyum@pm.me", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Builds vector tilesets in 'PMTiles' and 'MBTiles' from sf data
    frames, 'DuckDB' tables, 'Arrow' tables and files, with the tiles that
    'tippecanoe' makes from the same features. It runs the 'manby' program,
    which it downloads from the package's release on first use.
License: BSD_2_clause + file LICENSE
URL: https://birkskyum.github.io/manby/, https://github.com/birkskyum/manby
BugReports: https://github.com/birkskyum/manby/issues
Depends:
    R (>= 4.0)
Imports:
    jsonlite,
    nanoarrow,
    processx,
    stats,
    tools,
    utils
Suggests:
    arrow,
    DBI,
    dbplyr,
    dplyr,
    duckdb,
    sf,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    withr
OS_type: unix
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 7.2.3
